# Archtop notes: three-note shells and an occasional ninth answer, kept above the acoustic bass. The microphone channel carries pick and body detail.
# Archtop expression: laid-back isolated attacks, longer second answers, a held tonic and an empty final half-bar.
# Bass notes: sparse walking fragments connect roots and fifths; drums use sidestick and a gentle ride with no busy fill under the last chord.
